    "description": "The observed probabilities of pronouncing schwa in the eight French contexts of (19), from the experiment of Smith and Pater (2020), with the probabilities fitted by the four stochastic Harmonic Grammars and their deviances (Table 2). The text gives the deviances of MaxEnt and censored NHG as 12.8 and 14.6 in that order; the table, and the footnote on censored NHG, give 14.6 to MaxEnt and 12.8 to censored NHG."
